{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XKDc6kE9mZmW9EteqLn3Ev","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"commits\":[{\"hash\":\"a69b14a84bf925ff7cdf34e93ca1ffb4f257265f\",\"date\":\"2026-10-08T15:44:45+02:00\",\"message\":\"TRUNK-6799 Introduce Spring Security with support for legacy authentication context (#6544)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Rafal Korytkowski\",\"authorEmail\":\"rafal.korytkowski@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"f39e8f277c9e070bcb06032428bf0cf8cc8cc27a\",\"date\":\"2026-09-25T21:26:05+03:00\",\"message\":\"TRUNK-6702: Make UpdateFilter and InitializationFilter skip checks cheap after startup (#6434)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"jwnasambu\",\"authorEmail\":\"33891016+jwnasambu@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"e7052745fb78802c8adcd7c1962f3525e7050b1e\",\"date\":\"2026-06-12T21:54:53+03:00\",\"message\":\"TRUNK-6646: Env-var key normalization drops create_database_* / create_user_* credentials in scripted setup (#6145)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"jwnasambu\",\"authorEmail\":\"33891016+jwnasambu@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"949b8a177e825320b0d04108accf38fc48751ed3\",\"date\":\"2026-06-02T20:17:10+03:00\",\"message\":\"TRUNK-6643: Initial setup with MariaDB Driver does not work (#6150)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"jwnasambu\",\"authorEmail\":\"33891016+jwnasambu@users.noreply.github.com\"},{\"hash\":\"04a4cea80c7165fdfeaeb293cee89628d8a46b9e\",\"date\":\"2026-05-26T16:35:30+03:00\",\"message\":\"Stub InitializationFilter.startInstallation in E2E tests\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"InitializationFilterE2ETest's wizard-complete tests submit the\\nwizardcomplete.vm page to filter.doPost, which calls startInstallation\\nand spawns a real InitializationCompletion background thread on the\\nshared executor. That thread runs the actual setup using\\nwizardModel's default MySQL connection values and eventually calls\\nContext.setRuntimeProperties(...), overwriting whatever the next test\\nclass set in its constructor.\\n\\nThe background thread is asynchronous, so it races with subsequent\\ntests: SchedulerConfig.dataSource() reads Context.getRuntimeProperties\\nat bean-creation time, and when it's clobbered by the wizard's\\ndefault values, JobRunr's storageProvider fails to open the H2\\nconnection with 'Wrong user name or password'. The race resolves\\ndifferently across JVMs (Java 25 happened to pass, Java 21 didn't),\\nwhich made it look like flakiness.\\n\\nMake startInstallation protected and override it in\\nTestableInitializationFilter so the wizard-complete tests still\\nexercise the page-navigation logic without spawning the real thread.\\nThis also reverts the alphabetical surefire runOrder added earlier,\\nsince the fix no longer needs a particular test order.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\",\"authorName\":\"dkayiwa\",\"authorEmail\":\"dkayiwa@openmrs.org\"}],\"totalCount\":168}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e78987d5-96fb-454f-850c-616c7d00a64b","uuid":"90f1bd34-5624-436b-a1bc-96499654d349","timestamp":"2026-10-23T05:41:34.115Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"commits\":[{\"hash\":\"a69b14a84bf925ff7cdf34e93ca1ffb4f257265f\",\"date\":\"2026-10-08T15:44:45+02:00\",\"message\":\"TRUNK-6799 Introduce Spring Security with support for legacy authentication context (#6544)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\",\"authorName\":\"Rafal Korytkowski\",\"authorEmail\":\"rafal.korytkowski@gmail.com\"},{\"hash\":\"f39e8f277c9e070bcb06032428bf0cf8cc8cc27a\",\"date\":\"2026-09-25T21:26:05+03:00\",\"message\":\"TRUNK-6702: Make UpdateFilter and InitializationFilter skip checks cheap after startup (#6434)\",\"refs\":\"\",\"body\":\"\",\"authorName\":\"jwnasambu\",\"authorEmail\":\"33891016+jwnasambu@users.noreply.github.com\"}