the fix no longer needs a particular test order.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\\n\",\"authorName\":\"dkayiwa\",\"authorEmail\":\"dkayiwa@openmrs.org\"}],\"totalCount\":168}"}],"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01XKDc6kE9mZmW9EteqLn3Ev","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
