{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJdjerqQFn7AqhxRT3Qf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The fix for TRUNK-6646 is commit `e7052745fb78802c8adcd7c1962f3525e7050b1e` (\"Env-var key normalization drops create_database_* / create_user_* credentials in scripted setup\", PR #6145, by jwnasambu, 2026-06-12).\n\n**Root cause:** `InitializationFilter` copies every environment variable into the script properties under a normalized key. Unless the key is on a whitelist, `normalizeEnvVariableKey` lowercases it and turns `_` into `.`. So `CREATE_DATABASE_USERNAME` became `create.database.username`, and the lookup for `create_database_username` missed it. The wizard then kept its default of `root` with no password (the default is noted at `openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java:549`), which produced the \"Access denied\" failure.\n\n**The fix:** the commit adds the affected keys to `NON_NORMALIZED_KEYS`. These are `CREATE_DATABASE_USERNAME`, `CREATE_DATABASE_PASSWORD`, `CREATE_USER_USERNAME`, `CREATE_USER_PASSWORD`, plus `CONNECTION_DRIVER_CLASS`, `IMPORT_TEST_DATA`, `REMOTE_URL`, `REMOTE_USERNAME`, `REMOTE_PASSWORD` and `ADMIN_PASSWORD_LOCKED`. It also reads `connection_driver_class` and `import_test_data`/`add_demo_data` from the script, reads the remote settings, and copies all `property.*` entries from the merged `script` rather than from `installScript`. The whitelist change is the core of the fix. The other changes come along with it in the same commit.\n\nI confirmed the whitelist and method at their current line numbers in the checkout. The new unit tests in `InitializationFilterNormalizationTest.java` and `InitializationFilterTest.java` cover the behaviour. I did not run the tests.\n\nEvidence, best first:\n- `openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java:197-201`: the whitelist that now includes the create-database and create-user keys\n- `openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java:1948-1953`: `normalizeEnvVariableKey`, which skips lowercasing and dot conversion only for whitelisted keys\n- `openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java:340-343`: environment variables are merged into the script properties through that normalizer\n- `openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java:370-372`: the script reads `create_database_username` and `create_database_password`, which the old normalization never produced\n- `openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java:549`: the fallback to `root`\n- `openmrs-core/web/src/test/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilterNormalizationTest.java:1-92`: new tests asserting the underscore keys survive normalization\n- `openmrs-core/web/src/test/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilterTest.java:163-190`: new end-to-end test feeding these env vars through `initializeWizardFromResolvedPropertiesIfPresent`\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"path\": \"web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 197, \"endLine\": 201},\n  {\"path\": \"web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 1948, \"endLine\": 1953},\n  {\"path\": \"web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 340, \"endLine\": 343},\n  {\"path\": \"web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 370, \"endLine\": 372},\n  {\"path\": \"web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 549, \"endLine\": 549},\n  {\"path\": \"web/src/test/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilterNormalizationTest.java\", \"startLine\": 1, \"endLine\": 92},\n  {\"path\": \"web/src/test/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilterTest.java\", \"startLine\": 163, \"endLine\": 190},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-core\", \"commit\": \"e7052745fb78802c8adcd7c1962f3525e7050b1e\"},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-core\", \"pr\": 6145},\n  {\"ticket\": \"TRUNK-6646\"}\n]\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1468,"cache_read_input_tokens":27638,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1468},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e78987d5-96fb-454f-850c-616c7d00a64b","uuid":"d726217d-e70c-4ffb-b214-7c56a31cccce","timestamp":"2026-10-23T05:41:59.887Z","request_id":"req_011CgJdjeYzTyA2TCayAzr2d"}
